      "translation": "I feel pain in my heart whenever I happen to catch sight of Candrāvalī’s proud girlfriends, for they are all inimical to Rādhā’s camp.",
      "deva": [
        "जे-जे प्रतिकूल चन्द्रार सखी",
        "प्राने दुःख पाइ ताहारे देखि’"
